# --- s055 Book I d.18 q.3
n("n868","s055-01","vtrum caritas augeatur per extractionem partis noue de potentia ad actum","la","source","Compare Scotus, *Ord.* I d. 17 p. 2 q. 2 (against augmentation by the eduction of a new degree from the potency of the subject).","to-verify")
n("n869","s055-01","forma simplex subiectum esse non potest","la","intertext","Boethius, *De Trinitate* 2 (*forma vero quae est sine materia non poterit esse subiectum*). The wording is the scholastic *auctoritas*, not Boethius's own.","verified")
n("n870","s055-02","hic magister est Henricus quodlibeto. 5. q. 19.","la","source","Gorris identifies Scotus's anonymous *unus magister* as Henry of Ghent, *Quodl.* V q. 19 (on the intensification of forms). Not checked.","to-verify")
n("n871","s055-03","forma naturaliter educta","la","doctrinal","Charity is infused by God and not educed from the potency of the subject, otherwise it would be natural (a Pelagian consequence); hence *contra fidem*.","certain")
n("n872","s055-06","Tertia concluso","la","textual","Thus A, for *conclusio*.","verified")
n("n873","s055-06","quod caritas potest esse infinita actu vel potentia","la","textual","The sentence lists alternatives, apparently three ways of stating the third conclusion. The second alternative (*non actu sed bene potentia*) is the one Gorris accepts. The syntax is loose and possibly corrupt; B has not been compared.","uncertain")
n("n874","s055-07","producit obiecta sua inesse cognito","la","doctrinal","*Esse cognitum* (‘cognized being’): Scotus's doctrine that the divine intellect produces creatures in intelligible being (*esse diminutum*). See *Ord.* I d. 35 and d. 36. The rose example (*rosa*) is a stock case for an object that does not exist in reality (*rosa non existente*).","to-verify")
n("n875","s055-06","finite [and increasable] to infinity","en","translation","*finita in infinitum*: finite in act, but increasable without limit.")

# --- B collation (full): B73R–B74R
upd("n870", append="B reads *Hen. quolib. v. q. ix.* (A *q. 19*).")
n("n1007","s055-04","adducam tres conclusiones","la","textual","B: *adducam conclusiones* (om. *tres*).","certain")
